  {"term":"effective","meaning":"etkili","pos":"sıfat","ipa":"/ɪˈfektɪv/","example":"This medicine is very effective.","exampleTr":"Bu ilaç çok etkili.","usage":"Zıt anlamlısı “ineffective”; ismi “effectiveness”.","synonyms":["successful","efficient"],"topics":["akademik"],"exams":["IELTS","TOEFL","YDS"]},
